    "description": "Ram Verma is a Director at BigCat Realty, leading a team of 35 sales and marketing professionals focused on delivering premium real estate solutions across residential and commercial segments. With a strong background in mathematics and computer science, he also plays a key role in driving digital initiatives that enhance customer experience and expand market reach. \r\n\r\nWith over 12 years of experience in the real estate industry, Ram has built a proven track record of successfully closing high-value deals and exceeding sales targets. Prior to joining BigCat Realty in 2020, he worked with Future Realty India, where he gained extensive exposure to large-scale transactions and market-driven strategies. \r\n\r\nRam is known for building long-term relationships with investors, developers, and industry partners, supported by his strengths in leadership, negotiation, sales strategy, and problem-solving. He is passionate about delivering transparent, value-driven consulting services and contributing to the sustainable growth of BigCat Realty in a competitive real estate landscape.",
